<title>QATAR: Bosnian premier visits his counterpart in Qatar.</title>
<headline>Bosnian premier visits his counterpart in Qatar.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bosnian Prime Minister Hasan Muratovic met Qatar's Prime Minister Sheikh Abdullah bin Khalifa al-Thani in the Gulf state's capital Doha on Sunday, the official Qatar News Agency said.</p>
<p>They discussed bilateral relations and issues of common concern, the agency said. It gave no further details.</p>
